<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Monday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities vary slightly.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p> Citibank		11.00 /10.75   11.375/11.125   11.75 /11.50</p>
<p> Metrobank	     11.20 /10.80   11.50 /11.30</p>
<p>11.815/11.785</p>
<p> Multinational	 11.25 /11.00   11.75 /11.10    11.75 /11.20</p>
<p> StandChart Bank     11.25 /11.00   11.75 /11.50    12.25 /12.00</p>
